# 小屏, a finger: a chat of real size open as an agent works in it (src/sfbench/chat_real_scene.mbt): what it changes
# every 120 ms, as the core sends it, taken while the chat sits at its foot, then while it is flung up and comes back.
timeout 20000
until 发消息
wait 500
log measure
wait 3000
drag 195 640 0 -360 90
wait 1500
drag 195 300 0 360 90
wait 1500
exit
